---

<section class="how-section" id="como-funciona">
  <div class="container text-center">
    <span class="section-tag">Cómo Funciona</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">De señales dispersas a una decisión simple</h2>
    <p class="section-desc centered">
      Quadrapp organiza la información disponible sin prometer certezas: comunica probabilidad, confianza y antigüedad del dato.
    </p>

    <!-- 3 Cards Grid -->
    <div class="cards-grid">
      <!-- Card 01 -->
      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="card-header">
          <span class="step-num">01</span>
          <div class="icon-circle">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M4.93 19.07a10 10 0 0 1 0-14.14M7.76 16.24a6 6 0 0 1 0-8.48M12 12h.01M16.24 7.76a6 6 0 0 1 0 8.48M19.07 4.93a10 10 0 0 1 0 14.14"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3 class="card-title">Observa</h3>
        <p class="card-text">
          Sensores y gateways reportan ocupación y estados desconocidos.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 02 -->
      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="card-header">
          <span class="step-num">02</span>
          <div class="icon-circle">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M12 2v4M12 18v4M4.93 4.93l2.83 2.83M16.24 16.24l2.83 2.83M2 12h4M18 12h4M4.93 19.07l2.83-2.83M16.24 7.76l2.83-2.83"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3 class="card-title">Entiende</h3>
        <p class="card-text">
          El modelo considera flujo, historial, calendario académico y eventos.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 03 -->
      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="card-header">
          <span class="step-num">03</span>
          <div class="icon-circle">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M16 3h5v5M4 20L21 3M21 16v5h-5M15 15l6 6M4 4l5 5"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3 class="card-title">Anticipa</h3>
        <p class="card-text">
          Cada segmento recibe una vista útil: decisión de llegada u operación del turno.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .how-section {
    padding: 6rem 0;
    background-color: var(--color-bg-page);
  }

  .text-center {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .centered {
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .cards-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 2rem;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .step-card {
    background-color: #f3f9f8;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 2.25rem 2rem;
    transition: all var(--transition-smooth);
    position: relative;
  }

  .step-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 125, 112, 0.08);
    border-color: rgba(0, 125, 112, 0.3);
    background-color: #ffffff;
  }

  .card-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }

  .step-num {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--color-teal-primary);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .icon-circle {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: #d6eee8;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--color-teal-primary);
  }

  .icon-circle svg {
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
  }

  .card-title {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text-main);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .card-text {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .cards-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
